  "access": {
    "level": "public",
    "note": "Reached on foot. Magalloway Road is a gravel logging road; just over five miles in, a narrower and rougher road branches off and dead-ends three miles later at the trailheads, passable in a passenger car if driven slowly. The register links to a rental flyer for the cabin, which could not be opened. Whether the tower cab is open to visitors is not documented."
  },
